# The /app Vite sandbox is a dev-only component studio -- its entry points at
# /src/main.jsx, which only resolves under the dev server. On the deployed
# site it renders a blank page and hands out raw .jsx sources, so keep it off
# the production domain. Run it locally with `npm run dev` instead.
# The ! is required: Netlify serves a matching static file in preference to
# a redirect rule unless the status is forced, and app/index.html is real.
/app/*    /404.html    404!
